          <div class="mock mock-ai">
            <div class="bubble">best electrician in Tampa</div>
            <div class="ai-names">
              <span class="n">1.</span> <em>Competitor A</em>
              <span class="n">2.</span> <em>Competitor B</em>
              <span class="n">3.</span> <em>Competitor C</em>
            </div>
            <div class="fail-chip"><span>✗</span>You're not mentioned</div>
          </div>
          <div class="cover-copy">
            <h3>Who AI recommends</h3>
            <p>We ask ChatGPT and Gemini for the best electrician in your city. Who they name, and who they don't.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="sample">
      <div class="sample-inner">
        <div class="sample-copy">
          <div class="kicker light">WHAT IT LOOKS LIKE</div>
          <h2>This is what a Tampa electrician sees when they search for themselves.</h2>
          <p>
            Three shops in the pack, and the report shows why: all three have "Electric" in the
